British Isles accents (aiva-isles) voice pack
=============================================

Everything in this folder (voicepack.json, style/*.npy, clips/*, preview/*) is
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
license (CC-BY-SA-4.0), SPDX identifier: CC-BY-SA-4.0.

  Full legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode
  Human-readable summary: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Why this license: the voices are adaptations of recordings from the
ylacombe/english_dialects dataset, which is itself CC-BY-SA-4.0. The style
tensors are optimised to imitate those speakers, and the reference clips are
excerpts of the recordings, so both are derivative material and must carry the
same license (ShareAlike). See NOTICE for the attribution and the list of
changes.

Scope of the license: it applies to this folder only. The AIVoiceActing plugin
code and the rest of the plugin package are under their own terms and are not
affected; this pack is a separate data collection that the plugin loads at run
time. Audio you generate by speaking text with these voices is output of a
speech model and is not itself a copy of the dataset recordings.

You may use, copy and redistribute this pack, with or without changes, as long as
you keep this LICENSE and the NOTICE, credit the sources named there, say what you
changed, and share your adapted version under CC-BY-SA-4.0 (or a compatible license).

THE MATERIAL IS PROVIDED AS IS, WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND. See the legal code
linked above for the binding terms.
